Rpd5 out N013 {runit + (npd>=5 ? 0 : 1e9)}
Spd5 N013 vn pd 0 SWP
Rpd6 out N014 {runit + (npd>=6 ? 0 : 1e9)}
Spd6 N014 vn pd 0 SWP
Rpd7 out N015 {runit + (npd>=7 ? 0 : 1e9)}
